WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.650
We're finally at the semi-finals.

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.730
Just two more wins and we have the championship.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:12.740
W-We really made it this far.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.930
What's the point of getting nervous at <i>this</i>  point?

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:16.470
But I can't help it!

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.330
It's all right, Hayami.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:20.690
Let's win, everyone.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:22.040
We'll make this revolution a success.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:23.290
Yeah!

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.060
He's looking like a real captain.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:30.620
I wonder if Coach Endou will see the match today?

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:33.010
I'm sure he's watching somewhere.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:36.950
Our revolutionary wind will reach Coach Endou.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:38.030
Let's do our best!

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:38.710
Yeah.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:46.020
Arakumo Academy.

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:50.690
Both their individual skills and team tactics exceed excellence.

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:53.070
Everything about them is perfect.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:58.240
And they have a genius player, one said to come only once in a decade.

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:00.080
Only once in a decade?

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:01.620
Which one is it?

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:04.550
The team's source of goals, Nebuchi-kun,

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:06.250
Mazumi-kun,

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:09.630
and the goalkeeper with the least conceding goals in the tournament, Sata-kun...

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.040
I think it's one of them.

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:15.220
No matter who it is, we'll just play our very best!

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:16.970
Yeah!

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:33.980
So this is Desert Stadium.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:37.820
Just like the name, it's a field made of sand.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.710
But it doesn't feel any different from the usual dirt.

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:44.450
Still, we don't know what the trick is here.

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:45.980
Keep your guard up.

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:57.790
You came!

00:03:58.190 --> 00:03:59.890
So you can play?

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:01.490
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:02.680
Great.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:05.820
With you around, our victory is even more guaranteed...

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:06.300
Taiyou.

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:08.060
Taiyou?

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.350
Taiyou!

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.060
You were one of Arakumo's players?

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:16.220
But you...

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:20.810
<i>Taiyou-kun has been sick ever since he was little,</i>

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:23.680
<i>and he's forbidden from any intense exercise.</i>

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:25.430
<i>So soccer would be...</i>

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.490
I thought you shouldn't be playing soccer...

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:31.520
Otonashi-sensei, who's that player?

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:34.280
Amemiya Taiyou-kun, a first-year.

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:36.870
This is his first time appearing in Holy Road.

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:38.740
Amemiya...

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:41.000
I think I've heard that name somewhere before.

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:43.970
Wait, I'll see if there's any other information.

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:50.080
The semi-finals for Holy Road is 
 Raimon Jr. High versus Arakumo Academy!

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:56.180
Coach Kidou leads Raimon, the team that has struggled its way up.

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:59.080
They're up against Coach Karibe's Arakumo Academy,

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:03.200
who has gone up with ease thanks to their substantial offense and defense.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:06.530
Which team will earn the right to proceed to the finals?

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:16.590
Hey, Tenma.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:18.320
Taiyou!

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:20.610
I thought you weren't supposed to be to playing soccer.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:22.940
So you heard.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:24.510
That's right.

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:28.330
My body can't withstand intense sports like soccer.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:32.140
But I love soccer.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:34.640
So I practiced in secret.

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:37.350
I really enjoyed improving myself.

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:43.610
But the illness grew worse and the doctors had me stop playing.

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:50.800
That's when I saw Raimon's soccer and your plays.

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:56.990
My feelings for soccer burst out and I couldn't hold them back anymore.

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.410
I'll win against Raimon.

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:02.270
I'll win and take the championship.

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:07.030
I'll even kick out this illness in order to achieve that dream.

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:11.020
You want to play against us that much?

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:13.670
Even so, I can't afford to lose.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:22.340
It's too bad that you're not up as goalkeeper, even after all that practice, Shinsuke.

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:25.030
That's only natural. I'm still learning.

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:28.900
There are a lot of things I have to learn for being a goalkeeper.

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:32.820
But I promised Sangoku-senpai...

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:36.830
That I'll catch up to him some day.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:40.340
Here are the starting lineups!

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:43.940
Keep your eyes on Arakumo Academy's Amemiya Taiyou!

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:47.770
He's only a first-year, yet he bears the captain mark!

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:53.260
It was Amemiya-kun!

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:58.730
The genius player said to come only once in a decade, with world-class abilities...

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:01.690
He's that great of a player?

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.900
The medical team is on standby.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:16.210
So Arakumo Academy is finally using Amemiya-kun.

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:20.640
If they win against Raimon here, all of the votes will shift to Ishido-san,

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:23.840
securing you as the Holy Emperor.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.210
There's not a chance you can lose.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:35.680
Ishido-san, I'm the one who appointed you as the Holy Emperor, with the responsibility of administrating soccer in my place.

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:39.750
It would be problematic if you are unable to sustain that position.

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:41.180
I understand.

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:45.880
The Holy Road semi-finals with Raimon Jr. High versus Arakumo Academy!

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.150
Now is the kickoff!

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:50.770
I'll pass you!

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:54.080
W-What?

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.540
The field has suddenly moved!

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:03.480
This is Desert Stadium's feature, quicksand!

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:07.210
The players have to watch out for the randomly moving sand!

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:12.810
Here I come, Raimon!

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:16.050
Taiyou!

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:17.400
He passed Shindou?

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.570
Amazing, Taiyou.

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:20.140
But...!

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:30.430
Tenma, I've always wanted to fight you on the grounds like this.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.500
The sand is on the move!

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:39.830
So this is how the sand moves.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:42.000
I only learned of it just now.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.210
Then this is what I'll do!

00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:47.790
He kicked the ball to an empty place?

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:54.970
Amemiya Taiyou uses the sand to his advantage to keep the ball!

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:58.970
Even someone like me will go out under the sun one day!

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:03.230
I won't let anyone get in my way!

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:05.810
Amemiya easily gets past Raimon's defense!

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:07.900
He's one-on-one with the goalkeeper!

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:10.400
Please, body, hold out!

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:12.780
Until we've won the Holy Road championship!

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:23.200
Sun God Apollo!

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.330
Fence Of Gaia!

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:38.480
Goal!

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:40.400
Arakumo Academy takes the first goal!

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:43.110
Amemiya Taiyou scores all on his own!

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:47.100
Just what you'd expect from the once-in-a-decade genius!

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:49.100
He's only got one left.

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:51.380
Amemiya Taiyou...

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.440
He's so powerful.

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.630
Sangoku-senpai.

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:58.920
Amemiya Taiyou is a strong one.

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:02.760
I'll need your help in order to block his shoots.

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:07.540
It's only one point. We'll get back at them!

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:08.790
Yeah!

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:17.220
The quicksand stands in Raimon's way!

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:23.470
Arakumo Academy has left the offense to Amemiya while the rest stay on their half of the field.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.270
Their formation is solid!

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:27.480
Oh, fudge...

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:28.610
Taiyou!

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.400
Keep your mark on Amemiya!

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:36.370
Three from Raimon come to stop Amemiya!

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:38.260
Not even Amemiya can get through!

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:39.970
But he doesn't give up the ball!

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:42.780
I already knew this would happen!

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.140
Shinsuke, mark #10!

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:47.030
Okay!

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:53.980
He blocks it! Sangoku catches it this time!

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:58.420
He coaches over the defenders to bring the defense together!

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:00.760
I need to learn how to do that too!

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.620
Soccer has two types of playmakers.

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:06.320
The game strategist who commands the offense...

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:11.080
And the goalkeeper who leads the team's defense.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:15.600
Being key to the defense is what makes goalkeepers known as the guardian.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:19.820
Now if we could just get somewhere on the offense...

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:23.540
If we dodge the sand, enemies await.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:25.030
But if we dodge the enemies, sand awaits...

00:11:25.470 --> 00:11:27.010
What should we do?!

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.340
The sand traps our feet.

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:31.910
I see!

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:34.160
Tenma, over here!

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:35.130
Shinsuke.

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:40.160
This is how to prevent it from trapping my feet!

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:42.400
Sky Walk!

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:45.340
Captain!

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:50.100
Fortissimo!

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:58.420
Iron Wall Gigadon!

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:03.100
Taiyou!

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:16.130
Sun God Apollo!

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:19.470
Sunshine Force!

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:32.930
Hunter's Net!

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:36.390
Atlantis Wall!

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:41.940
Fence Of Gaia!

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:47.950
Goal!

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.250
Arakumo Academy scores its second goal!

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.420
Amemiya Taiyou makes it in once more!

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:56.890
Taiyou?

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:01.700
That's the limit.

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:06.800
Sangoku-senpai...

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:13.570
The only one who can block Amemiya's shoots is...

00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:19.940
Switch out the goalkeeper Sangoku with Nishizono!

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:24.890
Inazuma Eleven...

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:25.800
GO!

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:30.040
Inazuma Eleven...

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:30.790
GO!

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:35.940
What's this? Raimon has put Nishizono in the goalkeeper position!

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:41.040
What are Coach Kidou's intentions for switching out Sangoku when he's not even injured?

00:13:41.390 --> 00:13:44.710
Kurumada is stepping in for Nishizono's position!

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:46.790
Leave the defense to us!

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:48.790
We'll back up Shinsuke!

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:50.470
I'm counting on you, Kurumada!

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:54.420
Even Sangoku-senpai couldn't protect it...

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:56.150
Will I be able to?

00:13:56.990 --> 00:14:01.980
Wait, Sangoku-senpai has pride in his position as goalkeeper.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:05.490
And he's left it to me now.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.130
I'll do it!

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:10.110
I have to!

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:23.180
Nebuchi uses the sand to steal the ball!

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:24.130
Taiyou!

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:27.400
You won't get through this time!

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:29.610
We have to win this!

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:30.890
I'll be the one to win!

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:33.320
We're going to bring back real soccer!

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:37.100
I've risked everything for this moment!

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:43.480
What's this feeling I'm getting?

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:47.550
It's different from the time I played with him for the first time at the hospital.

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:50.120
It's not fun at all.

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:51.490
Why?

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:55.070
I can't stop when I've gotten this far!

00:14:58.200 --> 00:14:59.290
He's through!

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:02.440
Amemiya passes Matsukaze again!

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.630
He's unstoppable!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:08.860
Amemiya is slicing through Raimon's defense!

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:16.090
Amemiya passes after making a feint!

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:18.720
Nebuchi takes it!

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:21.470
He's one-on-one with Nishizono, who switched in just moments earlier!

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:24.980
I'll block it with my Avatar!

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.860
Shinsuke, use a punch!

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:30.890
All right!

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:34.890
Then how about this?!

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:43.210
Sea Emperor Neptune!

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:45.180
This time...!

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:48.000
Why?

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:50.350
Remember the training!

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.660
<i>Focus, Shinsuke!</i>

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:55.770
<i>Focus on blocking it!</i>

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:56.930
<i>Focus?</i>

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:00.600
All right, focus!

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:07.970
Heavy Aqua Lance!

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:13.710
I'll be the one to protect Raimon's goal!

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:20.410
Planet Guardian God Titanius!

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:25.860
He blocks it!

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:31.230
Raimon's goalkeeper Nishizono releases an Avatar to protect the goal!

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:34.440
It's the birth of a new and reliable guardian!

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:36.920
I blocked it...

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:39.290
I blocked it!

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:42.550
Yes!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:44.440
Shinsuke!

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:46.940
Sangoku-senpai!

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:50.500
All right, it's our turn to attack!

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:51.360
Yeah!

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:54.400
I've figured out the way through the sand.

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:58.260
The moment it starts shifting is the sign that it's going to run!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:01.580
God's Baton!

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:06.730
Nishizono's fine save has brought energy back into the Raimon Eleven!

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:08.920
They're charging in!

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.920
We'll make the revolution a success!

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:14.900
Shindou is finally one-on-one with the goalkeeper!

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:26.360
Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:35.550
Harmonics!

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:40.950
Iron Wall Gigadon!

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:45.050
Gigantic Bomb!

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:50.010
We'll bring back true soccer!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:54.910
Goal!

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:57.000
Raimon gets a point back!

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:59.780
Captain Shindou makes it in!

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:00.740
Yes!

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:01.830
All right!

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:02.470
Shin-sama!

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:04.420
It had to be Raimon.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:09.500
This is the Raimon I've been wanting to fight, Tenma.

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:12.740
We'll get another point!

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:13.730
Yeah!

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:18.290
I thought it'd be a one-sided match up until this point.

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:20.670
Soccer is quite interesting.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:25.940
Arakumo counterattacks!

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:28.290
Amemiya is at the center of it all again!

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:31.890
No one can stop Amemiya's super sharp dribbling!

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:35.250
I'll stop you!

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:44.600
Sun God Apollo!

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:51.850
Planet Guardian God Titanius!

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:54.690
Sunshine Force!

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:07.300
Majin The Hand!

00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:13.520
That's...!

00:19:14.390 --> 00:19:16.090
I did it!

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:20.560
Nishizono wins out in the clash between Avatar hissatsu techniques!

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:22.590
Amazing...

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:24.780
You're amazing, Raimon.

00:19:24.780 --> 00:19:27.560
Even stronger than I ever imagined.

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:29.820
Taiyou...

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:35.500
Shindou!

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:38.090
The ball is passed to Shindou again!

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:43.450
I'll stop you this time!

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:46.650
What?

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:57.090
Sword Saint Lancelot!

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:03.510
Lost Angel!

00:20:08.090 --> 00:20:10.410
Gigantic Bomb!

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:15.190
Goal!

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:17.300
Raimon catches up!

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:20.390
Captain Amemiya has scored all the points for Arakumo,

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:24.730
but Captain Shindou has been the key point for all of Raimon's goals!

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:26.440
Let's win this!

00:20:29.340 --> 00:20:32.210
Now at a tie, the match's intensity has increased!

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:35.760
But the flow is at Raimon's side! Arakumo desperately defends!

00:20:35.980 --> 00:20:38.750
Even Amemiya has fallen back to the defense!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:40.230
Taiyou...

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:45.570
He steals the ball from Hamano!

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:48.070
Will it be a solo stage for Amemiya once again?

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:53.280
Shindou finally steals the ball from Amemiya!

00:20:57.970 --> 00:20:58.810
Tenma!

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:02.840
Shindou passes to Matsukaze!

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:05.090
This is the decisive last pass!

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.530
I won't let you shoot!

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:16.540
Oh no, Matsukaze misses!

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:20.060
Raimon has let an opportune chance pass by them!

00:21:22.560 --> 00:21:24.460
The first half ends here.

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:27.680
The match has been a furious pass-off of making goals.

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.690
The second half will be exciting!

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:38.350
Matsukaze.

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:40.610
Why did you hold back?

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:48.160
You're the only one in Raimon who's not giving his all right now.

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:49.530
But...

00:21:50.130 --> 00:21:52.490
If you don't feel like playing, then leave the field.

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:26.950
Taiyou, I'll win against you in a serious match.

00:23:26.950 --> 00:23:29.260
I'll answer to your all-out plays!

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:30.410
Here I come!

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:33.800
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 Tenma VS Taiyou

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:35.760
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:45.100 --> 00:23:47.900
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:56.830
I'll kick out anything in order to achieve my dream!

00:23:56.830 --> 00:23:57.660
That's all!
